WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.510
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.510 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 20]

02:07.780 --> 02:09.500
Is that the Commander of the Imperial Guard Office

02:09.500 --> 02:11.020
Her Highness brought back from the frontier?

02:11.380 --> 02:11.860
They say

02:12.060 --> 02:13.740
she single-handedly stormed a Northern Desert outpost.

02:13.860 --> 02:14.900
Quite impressive.

02:17.820 --> 02:18.300
Qiang,

02:18.540 --> 02:19.780
you have a banquet to attend.

02:20.060 --> 02:21.700
While you may have caught Mr. Deng's eye,

02:21.860 --> 02:23.020
these century-old noble families...

02:23.140 --> 02:23.660
I shall decline.

02:25.300 --> 02:26.300
My rank

02:26.700 --> 02:27.820
was earned on the battlefield,

02:28.420 --> 02:29.500
not over drinks.

02:31.500 --> 02:32.780
You cannot turn this down.

02:33.180 --> 02:34.180
They're the direct descendants of the noble houses.

02:34.260 --> 02:35.340
If you choose Mr. Deng's invitation

02:35.500 --> 02:36.300
over theirs,

02:36.620 --> 02:37.940
you will bring talk upon yourself.

02:38.340 --> 02:39.060
Indeed,

02:39.580 --> 02:40.660
military merit is important,

02:40.980 --> 02:42.380
but without the support of the nobility,

02:42.660 --> 02:44.340
you will end up just like Xie Yanlai.

02:44.540 --> 02:45.100
Do you really intend

02:45.220 --> 02:46.060
to stake your life on a military pledge

02:46.060 --> 02:46.900
to kill the Northern Desert King

02:47.060 --> 02:49.300
just for the position of Guard General?

02:53.940 --> 02:54.740
Sir.

02:55.060 --> 02:55.620
Drink up.

03:01.140 --> 03:01.820
General Liang,

03:02.140 --> 03:03.740
a guest is offering you a toast.

03:03.900 --> 03:04.860
If they are offering a toast,

03:05.380 --> 03:06.180
why aren't they here

03:06.700 --> 03:07.580
to do it themselves?

03:07.860 --> 03:09.140
This liquor isn't from the tavern.

03:09.340 --> 03:10.860
The guest brewed it personally.

04:03.300 --> 04:03.780
Mr. Xie,

04:04.300 --> 04:04.940
Yu Shang has arrived.

04:05.420 --> 04:06.940
Greetings, Mr. Xie.

04:12.300 --> 04:13.940
This is a token of welcome

04:14.020 --> 04:15.580
from my master.

04:20.420 --> 04:22.620
Unearned gifts come with a price.

04:23.420 --> 04:25.380
Furthermore, this token

04:26.420 --> 04:27.820
is far too valuable.

04:32.100 --> 04:33.060
My master

04:33.580 --> 04:34.580
wishes to ask for a favor.

04:35.100 --> 04:37.420
Your reach is known to be unparalleled,

04:37.620 --> 04:39.060
so I was wondering if you might...?

04:39.060 --> 04:39.580
Du Qi,

04:40.540 --> 04:41.660
fetch some fine liquor.

04:42.460 --> 04:43.980
Let us welcome Yu Shang properly.

04:49.980 --> 04:50.820
I pride myself

04:51.220 --> 04:52.020
on many things,

04:52.980 --> 04:54.620
yet my tolerance for liquor is not one of them.

04:54.980 --> 04:55.940
Actually,

04:56.540 --> 04:58.620
my master has a fair capacity.

04:59.380 --> 05:00.220
I hope there will be a day

05:00.420 --> 05:03.260
when you can see that for yourself.

05:05.340 --> 05:05.820
Please.

05:14.220 --> 05:15.420
After defeating the Lord of Xiaonan,

05:15.740 --> 05:17.060
now that we have secured the greatest advantage,

05:17.900 --> 05:19.020
why continue to cooperate with him?

05:20.180 --> 05:22.060
The tides of power turn in an instant.

05:23.820 --> 05:25.820
Her Highness's recent moves

05:27.180 --> 05:28.260
are aimed at nothing more

05:28.260 --> 05:29.460
than reclaiming control at court.

05:31.140 --> 05:32.980
We must prepare a foolproof response.

05:34.380 --> 05:35.180
What about Deng Yi?

05:36.980 --> 05:37.860
Well,

05:38.900 --> 05:40.820
Liang Qiang's ambition to revive his family

05:41.380 --> 05:42.780
is plain for all to see.

05:43.740 --> 05:44.740
Her Highness

05:44.740 --> 05:45.860
founded the Imperial Guard Office

05:46.740 --> 05:48.500
and has turned the Capital on its ear.

05:49.420 --> 05:50.740
Fearing for their own skins,

05:51.420 --> 05:52.380
the officials have only served

05:53.220 --> 05:54.940
to allow Deng Yi to overshadow the court.

05:55.900 --> 05:56.940
This is something

05:56.940 --> 05:57.860
Her Highness cannot accept.

05:58.980 --> 05:59.860
My condition

06:00.820 --> 06:02.300
is not likely to improve any time soon.

06:03.540 --> 06:04.620
I'll leave the court affairs

06:05.340 --> 06:06.900
to Her Highness

06:06.900 --> 06:08.060
and Mr. Deng to settle.

06:08.620 --> 06:09.140
Understood.

06:17.580 --> 06:18.060
Mr. Xie,

06:19.380 --> 06:20.540
have some sobering soup.

06:30.020 --> 06:31.420
How is Yanlai?

06:33.220 --> 06:33.940
Where has he reached?

06:34.820 --> 06:35.900
Did he have a safe journey?

06:36.580 --> 06:37.260
Rest assured.

06:37.940 --> 06:39.100
Everything has been taken care of,

06:39.660 --> 06:40.420
and everyone concerned

06:40.900 --> 06:41.820
has been notified.

06:48.140 --> 06:48.860
Eat up.

06:50.380 --> 06:50.820
Here,

06:51.140 --> 06:51.860
take this for the road.

06:55.740 --> 06:56.260
General,

06:56.740 --> 06:57.980
even the finest pastries

06:58.020 --> 06:58.900
are meant to be eaten,

06:58.980 --> 06:59.860
not stared at.

07:00.540 --> 07:01.860
If you keep looking at them for another few days,

07:02.260 --> 07:03.380
they will surely spoil.

07:12.860 --> 07:13.300
Kneel.

07:13.820 --> 07:15.020
General, we caught one alive.

07:16.420 --> 07:17.180
Who sent you?

07:21.460 --> 07:22.460
I have no patience for this.

07:22.780 --> 07:23.620
Just kill me.

07:36.660 --> 07:37.540
Remember to clean this up.

07:37.780 --> 07:38.180
Yes.

07:42.940 --> 07:44.220
After the fire at the Wei Village,

07:44.740 --> 07:45.820
our men arrived a moment too late.

07:46.380 --> 07:47.300
This was the only scrap

07:47.780 --> 07:49.100
we found in the ruins.

07:50.020 --> 07:50.580
Keeping it all these years

07:50.580 --> 07:51.580
has been no mean feat, Your Highness.

07:53.260 --> 07:55.380
When Xie Yanlai was on the ship,

07:55.940 --> 07:57.380
he lost his composure

07:58.020 --> 07:59.060
the moment the Wei Village was mentioned.

07:59.620 --> 08:00.340
Clearly,

08:00.780 --> 08:02.340
this is his raw nerve.

08:02.620 --> 08:03.420
If

08:03.780 --> 08:04.780
we could truly find

08:04.780 --> 08:06.580
that child named Xiang,

08:08.220 --> 08:08.940
perhaps

08:09.740 --> 08:10.940
we could finally get a hold

08:10.940 --> 08:12.940
over the new Guard General.

08:13.540 --> 08:14.220
Please forgive my ignorance,

08:14.580 --> 08:16.340
but would Xie Yanlai really care

08:16.340 --> 08:17.740
about such a threat?

08:18.740 --> 08:19.460
He would.

08:20.460 --> 08:23.140
After all, the Xie Yanlai of today

08:23.900 --> 08:26.980
is far more human than he once was.

08:27.700 --> 08:28.500
And

08:29.980 --> 08:32.460
to be human is to be shackled

08:33.220 --> 08:34.660
by one's soft spots.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.560
Mr. Xie has come as summoned.

08:40.120 --> 08:41.080
Show him in.

08:55.340 --> 08:56.220
Your Highness, be careful.

08:59.100 --> 09:00.340
Don't dip the pastry in the cinnabar.

09:02.380 --> 09:03.220
Yanfang,

09:03.740 --> 09:04.460
is your health improving?

09:05.060 --> 09:05.460
Take a seat.

09:07.500 --> 09:08.180
It is an old ailment.

09:08.900 --> 09:09.740
It always flares up

09:10.100 --> 09:11.100
during the turn of the seasons.

09:15.060 --> 09:16.820
However, with the court in such chaos,

09:17.500 --> 09:18.580
I have been bedridden

09:18.900 --> 09:20.100
and unable to assist Your Highness.

09:20.940 --> 09:21.700
I come to seek your punishment.

09:26.580 --> 09:27.420
How are you

09:27.900 --> 09:28.660
at fault?

09:29.260 --> 09:30.220
My inaction, Your Highness,

09:30.980 --> 09:32.540
is truly for your own good.

09:33.580 --> 09:35.820
If you rely on the Xie Clan to suppress Deng Yi,

09:36.220 --> 09:37.340
to the court,

09:38.060 --> 09:39.900
you are nothing but a puppet dependent on others.

09:40.740 --> 09:41.700
If that happens, all the achievements

09:41.700 --> 09:42.900
you earned yourself,

09:43.420 --> 09:44.340
the mandate from the late Emperor,

09:44.860 --> 09:45.740
the Battle Against the Northern Desert,

09:46.260 --> 09:47.380
and the defeat of the Lord of Xiaonan,

09:48.060 --> 09:48.780
none of those

09:49.340 --> 09:50.540
will truly belong to you.

09:51.500 --> 09:53.140
But should Your Highness subdue the court alone,

09:53.500 --> 09:54.340
you shall become

09:54.340 --> 09:55.140
an unquestioned authority,

09:55.420 --> 09:56.940
truly holding the reins,

09:57.460 --> 09:58.780
and thus,

09:59.220 --> 10:00.380
a third force,

10:01.140 --> 10:02.260
independent of Mr. Deng

10:03.500 --> 10:05.180
and the Xie Clan.

10:09.220 --> 10:11.460
Are you truly happy to see this happen?

10:12.740 --> 10:13.740
I have always believed

10:15.020 --> 10:16.260
that everything Your Highness attains

10:18.460 --> 10:19.780
is what you deserve.

10:20.520 --> 10:21.660
What if I lose?

10:26.980 --> 10:28.820
By that time, Your Highness will remember

10:31.340 --> 10:32.340
that I am still here.

10:39.180 --> 10:39.780
I have said my piece,

10:40.260 --> 10:40.980
so I will take my leave,

10:41.540 --> 10:42.940
lest I pass my sickness on to Your Highness.

10:43.380 --> 10:44.780
Rest well.

10:44.900 --> 10:45.620
I will not forfeit

10:45.780 --> 10:47.100
your trust.

10:50.460 --> 10:51.340
I have always believed

10:52.140 --> 10:53.180
in Your Highness.

11:12.140 --> 11:13.540
Why is he being so obsequious?

11:15.260 --> 11:16.460
He merely senses

11:17.020 --> 11:18.540
the stalemate is ending,

11:19.100 --> 11:19.820
and the show must conclude.

11:25.340 --> 11:27.620
[Northern Desert Army Camp]

11:29.260 --> 11:29.820
Your Majesty,

11:30.540 --> 11:31.660
Xie Yanlai has declared

11:32.260 --> 11:33.380
that within half a year,

11:33.620 --> 11:35.100
he will come for your head.

11:44.900 --> 11:46.420
That brat

11:46.780 --> 11:47.900
is quite arrogant.

11:50.660 --> 11:51.580
Very well,

11:52.660 --> 11:53.780
then I shall see

11:54.860 --> 11:56.900
if he takes my head first,

11:57.540 --> 11:59.220
or I spill his blood

11:59.540 --> 12:01.540
to consecrate the banner of the Northern Desert Army.

12:07.020 --> 12:08.900
Zheng Xia's examination fraud

12:09.300 --> 12:10.540
has been confirmed.

12:11.420 --> 12:13.100
By the laws of the State of Chu,

12:13.460 --> 12:15.700
he is to be executed this autumn.

12:21.620 --> 12:22.500
Why

12:23.100 --> 12:24.540
is Zheng Xia sentenced to death?

12:25.460 --> 12:26.100
What?

12:29.020 --> 12:29.780
I said,

12:30.820 --> 12:32.660
"why is Zheng Xia sentenced to death?"

12:33.380 --> 12:35.180
When I inquired about the case earlier,

12:35.580 --> 12:36.300
wasn't it said

12:36.540 --> 12:37.780
that a retrial would be held after the autumn?

12:46.140 --> 12:48.220
Since none of you will answer,

12:48.620 --> 12:49.420
today,

12:50.340 --> 12:51.220
I shall deliberate

12:51.220 --> 12:52.860
on this case myself.

12:54.700 --> 12:56.700
Zheng Xia, a subordinate clerk in Jingzhou,

12:56.940 --> 12:58.860
stands accused of selling imperial examination questions.

12:59.980 --> 13:02.180
Yet a thorough review of the case yields no concrete evidence.

13:02.980 --> 13:04.660
The person involved is your pupil, Mr. Deng.

13:04.900 --> 13:06.620
Are you aware of this?

13:11.020 --> 13:11.900
Zheng Xia has been wronged.

13:12.620 --> 13:14.180
I ask Your Highness to order a retrial.

13:19.260 --> 13:20.220
I recognize you,

13:20.540 --> 13:21.500
Censor Zhu Yong.

13:22.540 --> 13:23.580
You say Zheng Xia is wronged.

13:23.820 --> 13:25.620
Explain exactly how.

13:26.100 --> 13:27.580
The seal Zheng Xia applied

13:28.340 --> 13:29.300
is not the same one

13:29.340 --> 13:30.580
the Clerk broke

13:31.060 --> 13:32.220
at the examination hall.

13:34.060 --> 13:35.580
The court record is clear

13:35.860 --> 13:37.100
that the handwriting is verified.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.580
Zheng Xia is left-handed.

13:39.220 --> 13:40.220
Due to social prejudice,

13:40.540 --> 13:41.860
he practiced writing with his right hand.

13:42.660 --> 13:43.500
On the day of the crime,

13:43.940 --> 13:45.660
he deliberately sealed it with his left hand.

13:46.220 --> 13:47.100
Though the writing resembles his usual style,

13:47.820 --> 13:49.100
the brushwork is different.

13:50.340 --> 13:51.500
Then why didn't he prove his innocence?

13:52.060 --> 13:53.180
After his arrest,

13:53.860 --> 13:55.500
the yamen runner broke his left hand.

13:56.100 --> 13:57.620
Since then, he has been unable to write,

13:58.460 --> 13:59.460
much less clear his name.

14:00.820 --> 14:02.540
It seems this case is indeed suspicious

14:02.980 --> 14:03.900
and requires a retrial.

14:18.900 --> 14:19.420
Zhu Yong,

14:19.820 --> 14:20.540
have you lost your mind?

14:21.460 --> 14:22.180
Are you willing

14:22.380 --> 14:23.300
to throw away your future

14:23.300 --> 14:23.980
for Zheng Xia?

14:24.460 --> 14:25.220
He is innocent.

14:25.900 --> 14:26.940
I cannot just stand by.

14:27.780 --> 14:28.820
Past connections

14:29.260 --> 14:30.420
don't obligate you

14:30.620 --> 14:31.340
to accept his claims.

14:32.020 --> 14:32.740
He was unlucky enough

14:32.900 --> 14:33.940
to be caught in the political crossfire.

14:34.300 --> 14:35.540
With those scholars jumping into the river

14:35.980 --> 14:36.900
and the matter blowing up,

14:37.420 --> 14:39.260
someone has to pay with their life.

14:39.500 --> 14:40.620
I don't know about the others,

14:41.260 --> 14:41.820
but Zheng was barred

14:41.820 --> 14:42.860
from serving in the Capital

14:42.860 --> 14:43.660
because of his corruption.

14:44.460 --> 14:45.380
He chose to remain in Jingzhou

14:45.380 --> 14:46.140
as a flawed official,

14:46.220 --> 14:47.220
because he vowed

14:47.620 --> 14:48.260
to despise

14:48.260 --> 14:49.540
academic fraud above all

14:50.220 --> 14:51.140
and shield students

14:51.140 --> 14:52.180
from falling as he once did.

14:52.500 --> 14:53.820
And you fell for such high-sounding talk?

14:55.100 --> 14:56.140
Well,

14:56.540 --> 14:57.300
now he's doomed,

14:57.900 --> 14:58.980
and so are you.

14:59.940 --> 15:01.060
But Her Highness believes...

15:04.180 --> 15:05.940
What Her Highness believes matters little.

15:06.660 --> 15:09.180
She is merely using this as a pretext.

15:10.260 --> 15:11.420
Do you truly think she cares

15:11.460 --> 15:13.140
about the life of a minor official?

15:13.580 --> 15:14.620
She just wants someone

15:14.660 --> 15:15.820
to support her claims.

15:16.340 --> 15:18.220
The officials dismiss her words,

15:18.500 --> 15:19.860
nor can they do anything to her.

15:20.100 --> 15:20.740
But you?

15:21.380 --> 15:22.260
You are

15:23.100 --> 15:23.780
absolutely finished.

15:37.580 --> 15:38.900
Take him away to the rack.

15:39.100 --> 15:39.460
Yes.

15:39.580 --> 15:40.460
- My Lord! - Move.

15:40.580 --> 15:41.580
I'm innocent!

15:41.660 --> 15:43.020
I swear on my life, My Lord!

15:43.180 --> 15:44.700
I've been wronged!

15:45.380 --> 15:46.820
By the order of Her Highness, the Imperial Guard Office

15:47.060 --> 15:49.060
is retrieving Zheng Xia, the Subordinate Clerk.

15:52.140 --> 15:52.540
My Lady,

15:53.020 --> 15:54.100
this case is being tried by the Commandant of Justice.

15:54.380 --> 15:55.220
Even for a transfer,

15:55.420 --> 15:56.820
it requires extensive paperwork.

15:57.140 --> 15:58.300
I don't understand the procedures

15:58.300 --> 15:58.860
of the Commandant of Justice's Office,

15:59.300 --> 16:00.020
nor do I need to.

16:00.780 --> 16:02.460
I act

16:02.940 --> 16:03.940
only

16:03.940 --> 16:04.900
on Her Highness's orders.

16:05.420 --> 16:05.900
Bring him out.

16:06.260 --> 16:06.780
- Yes. - Yes.

16:07.260 --> 16:08.860
They are breaking into the prison!

16:09.260 --> 16:09.860
How dare you!

16:10.220 --> 16:10.980
Have you no respect for the law?

16:11.060 --> 16:11.740
Someone!

16:13.020 --> 16:13.660
The Imperial Guard Office

16:13.660 --> 16:15.020
is acting on Her Highness's authority.

16:15.500 --> 16:16.820
Anyone who obstructs us will be charged with treason

16:17.580 --> 16:18.620
and executed without trial.

16:26.740 --> 16:27.380
Mr. Xie,

16:28.020 --> 16:28.700
the Imperial Guard Office has raided

16:28.700 --> 16:29.580
the Commandant of Justice's prison.

16:30.260 --> 16:31.140
I heard the news

16:31.140 --> 16:31.900
and rushed over,

16:32.180 --> 16:33.220
only to find the guards

16:33.220 --> 16:33.940
lying everywhere.

16:34.220 --> 16:34.860
The Imperial Guard Office

16:34.860 --> 16:36.300
is parading Zheng Xia through the streets.

16:36.500 --> 16:37.260
This morning,

16:37.580 --> 16:38.540
they stormed

16:38.540 --> 16:39.420
Chancellor Jiang's residence

16:39.660 --> 16:40.900
and dragged him away

16:40.900 --> 16:41.740
mid-feast.

16:42.540 --> 16:43.860
The Jiang Clan is a house of letters, three generations deep.

16:44.380 --> 16:46.180
Even the late Emperor gave them due deference.

16:46.580 --> 16:47.100
These brutes

16:47.100 --> 16:48.300
have truly run wild.

16:49.940 --> 16:50.740
Well done.

16:51.540 --> 16:52.860
Mr. Xie, you're actually praising them?

16:53.300 --> 16:53.980
They have kidnapped Zheng Xia.

16:53.980 --> 16:54.860
But what good does that do?

16:55.820 --> 16:56.980
It has caused panic.

16:57.500 --> 16:58.140
What if they decide to storm

16:58.140 --> 16:59.380
the Xie Residence tomorrow?

17:01.180 --> 17:01.900
Du Qi,

17:02.620 --> 17:04.300
this case is like this game.

17:05.140 --> 17:06.060
The black and white are entangled,

17:06.620 --> 17:07.740
yet no one dares to make a breakthrough.

17:09.740 --> 17:11.620
Zheng Xia is merely a discarded pawn

17:11.620 --> 17:12.660
in a compromise between forces.

17:13.780 --> 17:16.500
Her Highness is playing the white piece to break the deadlock.

17:17.580 --> 17:19.980
The more chaotic the situation, the better it is for us.

17:22.140 --> 17:23.060
Mr. Deng, on the other hand,

17:23.980 --> 17:24.940
should be getting a headache.

17:26.020 --> 17:27.540
The most brilliant players

17:29.620 --> 17:31.980
never have to place their own pieces.

17:49.980 --> 17:51.020
Mr. Deng,

17:51.260 --> 17:52.580
how do you find the time to visit me today?

17:52.940 --> 17:54.580
Your Highness, you must stop this.

17:55.540 --> 17:56.500
You allowed the Imperial Guard Office

17:56.500 --> 17:58.220
to arrest a senior official in the streets

17:58.860 --> 18:00.500
and snatch a prisoner.

18:01.300 --> 18:02.380
I am investigating a case

18:02.740 --> 18:03.900
and looking into

18:04.540 --> 18:05.900
how you are involved

18:06.020 --> 18:06.900
in this fraud.

18:07.060 --> 18:08.540
This is not an investigation, Your Highness,

18:09.060 --> 18:10.260
for you are trampling

18:10.260 --> 18:11.300
upon the laws of the court...

18:13.100 --> 18:14.700
and allowing the Imperial Guard Office

18:15.220 --> 18:16.420
to run wild.

18:28.660 --> 18:30.420
You say I disregard the law?

18:31.420 --> 18:31.980
It was you

18:31.980 --> 18:33.220
who blinded yourself to the inconsistencies

18:33.220 --> 18:34.020
of Zheng Xia's case.

18:34.380 --> 18:35.300
It was you

18:35.780 --> 18:37.260
who countenanced

18:37.260 --> 18:38.220
such brutal torment.

18:38.740 --> 18:39.620
And it was also you

18:40.380 --> 18:41.780
who turned a deaf ear to the blood

18:41.780 --> 18:42.820
and pleas of the innocent.

18:43.980 --> 18:45.140
If you want the court to act

18:45.140 --> 18:46.380
as if I do not exist,

18:46.980 --> 18:47.460
very well.

18:48.260 --> 18:49.900
I shall use this case

18:50.500 --> 18:52.180
to show everyone

18:52.940 --> 18:53.980
how you trample

18:53.980 --> 18:55.340
on the law,

18:56.020 --> 18:57.860
and whether

18:58.340 --> 18:59.380
I have the authority

18:59.380 --> 19:00.180
to intervene in state affairs.

19:00.980 --> 19:01.780
I will see this case through

19:01.780 --> 19:02.780
to the end,

19:03.340 --> 19:04.300
and I will uncover

19:04.940 --> 19:06.580
every hidden truth.

19:13.420 --> 19:14.620
Your Highness, please do not forget

19:15.460 --> 19:17.820
I am the Regent by the late Emperor's decree.

19:18.180 --> 19:20.380
It's true,

19:20.780 --> 19:21.460
but I am

19:22.060 --> 19:23.700
the Grand Princess of State,

19:23.700 --> 19:25.100
appointed by the same grace.

19:25.660 --> 19:26.380
So what?

19:26.500 --> 19:27.740
Anything that threatens

19:27.740 --> 19:29.020
the integrity of the court

19:29.340 --> 19:31.220
falls within my authority.

19:57.420 --> 19:59.420
[Seven Days Later]

20:01.020 --> 20:02.140
The Jingzhou Prefect reports

20:02.460 --> 20:02.980
that

20:03.180 --> 20:05.100
there have been several clashes between the Jingzhou city guards

20:05.540 --> 20:06.500
and the Imperial Guard Office,

20:06.860 --> 20:07.940
resulting in over a dozen casualties.

20:09.300 --> 20:10.580
The court will send someone to Jingzhou

20:10.580 --> 20:12.260
to pacify the people

20:13.380 --> 20:15.260
and set things right.

20:15.940 --> 20:17.420
Setting things right?

20:17.780 --> 20:19.380
So clearly, Mr. Deng represents the "right",

20:19.860 --> 20:20.900
and Her Highness the opposite.

20:21.100 --> 20:23.380
Commander Mu Xiaoman of the Imperial Guard Office

20:23.380 --> 20:25.140
requests an audience.

20:25.740 --> 20:26.820
The Commander of the Imperial Guard Office

20:26.860 --> 20:27.740
is not a court official.

20:28.220 --> 20:29.220
By what right does she trespass?

20:29.980 --> 20:31.020
Dismiss her.

20:31.180 --> 20:31.660
Admit her.

20:33.300 --> 20:36.100
Let Mu Xiaoman enter.

20:47.500 --> 20:48.380
Greetings, Your Majesty.

20:49.260 --> 20:50.060
Your Highness,

20:50.500 --> 20:51.860
I have concluded the investigation

20:51.980 --> 20:52.820
into the Zheng Xia case.

20:53.580 --> 20:55.540
The true culprit is Jingzhou Clerk Chi Yu.

20:56.900 --> 20:58.620
Exposed for trading examination papers,

20:58.860 --> 21:00.380
he tried to shift the blame onto Zheng Xia.

21:01.060 --> 21:02.100
Not only did he order a yamen runner

21:02.100 --> 21:03.100
to break Zheng Xia's left hand

21:03.100 --> 21:03.940
to destroy evidence,

21:04.420 --> 21:06.060
but he also bribed the Chancellor of the Directorate of Education

21:06.340 --> 21:07.380
to cover his tracks.

21:07.980 --> 21:09.580
Here are the confessions from Chi Yu and the yamen runner.

21:16.900 --> 21:18.620
The culprits have been brought to the Capital

21:18.900 --> 21:19.740
to await sentencing.

21:21.180 --> 21:21.820
Rise.

21:25.220 --> 21:26.620
You have all heard

21:27.100 --> 21:27.980
and seen the truth.

21:28.820 --> 21:30.060
This case was never complex.

21:30.700 --> 21:31.500
It is the human mind

21:32.180 --> 21:33.300
that is complex.

21:34.380 --> 21:35.860
The noble families in Jingzhou

21:36.220 --> 21:37.860
trade state examinations at will,

21:38.380 --> 21:39.260
the Clerk

21:39.580 --> 21:41.220
frames the innocent at whim,

21:41.620 --> 21:43.660
and the Chancellor of the Directorate of Education lines pockets with bribes.

21:44.540 --> 21:46.500
To them, an upright official

21:46.780 --> 21:47.740
from a humble background

21:47.740 --> 21:48.540
is nothing more

21:48.540 --> 21:49.860
than an ant to be crushed.

21:52.540 --> 21:53.260
Mr. Deng,

21:53.860 --> 21:55.820
the Clerk and Chancellor

21:56.380 --> 21:57.980
are your pupils.

21:59.780 --> 22:01.740
We shall discuss this matter later.

22:05.540 --> 22:06.900
I beseech Your Highness

22:07.580 --> 22:09.220
to bring these people to justice at once.

22:11.220 --> 22:13.620
He is siding with Her Highness.

22:14.660 --> 22:16.180
How dare a mere censor

22:16.780 --> 22:17.700
challenge

22:18.380 --> 22:19.700
Mr. Deng?

22:21.620 --> 22:22.260
Granted.

22:22.700 --> 22:23.900
For the Zheng Xia examination fraud,

22:24.180 --> 22:25.740
spare no one and punish all involved

22:26.060 --> 22:27.100
with the utmost severity.

22:28.140 --> 22:28.740
My deepest gratitude

22:29.260 --> 22:30.460
for Your Majesty's grace.

22:50.060 --> 22:51.780
Your Highness, this was a masterful move.

22:52.540 --> 22:53.620
With the Zheng Xia case overturned,

22:54.140 --> 22:55.540
thirty percent of the officials in Jingzhou

22:55.540 --> 22:56.300
will need to be replaced.

22:57.220 --> 22:58.140
You are mistaken.

22:58.580 --> 23:00.100
It was not my strategy that was masterful.

23:00.900 --> 23:01.860
It was Chi Yu and the others

23:02.100 --> 23:03.380
who forced their own destruction.

23:04.140 --> 23:05.180
Does Your Highness realize

23:06.020 --> 23:07.300
that you have purged

23:07.300 --> 23:08.780
more than just a few corrupt officials?

23:09.820 --> 23:11.740
You have broken the unwritten rules

23:11.740 --> 23:13.460
the noble families have upheld for over a century.

23:13.700 --> 23:14.460
Rules?

23:16.260 --> 23:17.980
Are these the rules of selling offices for wealth,

23:18.540 --> 23:20.460
or the rules of protecting each other's corruption?

23:21.620 --> 23:22.220
Your Highness,

23:23.780 --> 23:25.100
by eliminating my people,

23:26.460 --> 23:28.580
are you not afraid that Xie Yanfang will grow stronger?

23:29.580 --> 23:31.820
It will be even harder to control him then.

23:32.980 --> 23:34.020
I have my own arrangements

23:34.540 --> 23:36.340
for Xie Yanfang.

23:37.140 --> 23:38.980
You should worry about yourself.

23:54.940 --> 23:55.620
Mr. Xie,

23:56.180 --> 23:56.940
Mr. Deng and Her Highness

23:56.940 --> 23:58.100
are at each other's throats,

23:58.860 --> 23:59.540
yet here you are,

23:59.540 --> 24:00.700
living like a recluse.

24:01.620 --> 24:02.300
Why the rush?

24:03.060 --> 24:04.220
It has only just begun.

24:04.940 --> 24:06.140
His Majesty has dispatched the Censor

24:06.140 --> 24:06.820
to Jingzhou.

24:07.340 --> 24:08.020
The truth

24:08.020 --> 24:09.060
will soon be brought to light.

24:10.100 --> 24:10.620
Will Deng Yi make

24:10.620 --> 24:11.420
a move?

24:11.740 --> 24:12.860
Are we truly not going to intervene?

24:14.620 --> 24:16.060
If he were truly intelligent,

24:16.660 --> 24:17.740
he would know

24:17.740 --> 24:19.100
that these are all discarded pawns.

24:19.980 --> 24:21.540
Entangling himself in a lost game

24:23.060 --> 24:24.220
is a futile waste of strength.

24:24.820 --> 24:26.340
What do you mean?

24:28.500 --> 24:29.820
Do you remember the Military Supervisor

24:29.820 --> 24:31.340
sent to the frontier troops a few days ago?

24:33.660 --> 24:34.260
Let's wait and see.

24:36.620 --> 24:38.060
The best part is yet to come.

24:46.900 --> 24:48.060
That wretched Military Supervisor

24:48.780 --> 24:50.220
just struts about the camp all day,

24:50.740 --> 24:52.660
shielding himself behind the Token.

24:53.020 --> 24:54.420
Nowhere to be found when the war starts,

24:54.820 --> 24:56.580
but now he is here throwing his weight around.

24:58.100 --> 24:59.660
With the war so critical,

25:00.060 --> 25:01.980
I cannot allow such mediocrities

25:02.260 --> 25:03.500
to lord it over this camp.

25:04.340 --> 25:05.060
Military Supervisor Fu,

25:06.140 --> 25:07.900
what pearls of wisdom do you have today?

25:08.780 --> 25:10.540
The Adjutant General of Changping Pass

25:10.900 --> 25:12.660
recorded the third quarter of the Xu hour

25:12.780 --> 25:14.540
as the start of the hour.

25:14.740 --> 25:15.700
Such carelessness

25:15.860 --> 25:16.860
is intolerable.

25:17.980 --> 25:18.900
General, I request

25:19.100 --> 25:20.700
that you cashier and investigate the person at once.

25:20.980 --> 25:23.540
His immediate superior is also to blame.

25:25.100 --> 25:26.820
What sharp eyes you have.

25:27.260 --> 25:29.100
Dismissed for a single misrecorded quarter?

25:29.700 --> 25:32.020
Why not behead him

25:32.020 --> 25:32.860
to set an example?

25:33.020 --> 25:33.980
That would be far more efficient.

25:34.900 --> 25:35.900
The troop rotation is a serious matter,

25:36.540 --> 25:38.100
not to be trifled with.

25:38.460 --> 25:40.460
If there are any lapses

25:40.740 --> 25:42.940
that give the Northern Desert scouts an opening,

25:43.300 --> 25:46.340
who will bear the consequences?

25:48.940 --> 25:50.580
General Zhong, you surely wouldn't want

25:50.580 --> 25:52.420
to shield them by using the urgency of the war

25:52.460 --> 25:53.660
as a pretense?

25:55.220 --> 25:56.740
Frontier troops reward and punish without fail.

25:57.020 --> 25:57.740
Those who deserve death

25:58.420 --> 25:59.140
will not be spared.

25:59.660 --> 26:00.300
Good.

26:00.820 --> 26:02.860
I am reassured.

26:03.380 --> 26:04.100
However,

26:04.500 --> 26:06.820
you are Her Highness's right-hand man,

26:07.220 --> 26:09.220
so do not disappoint her expectations.

26:11.420 --> 26:13.180
You may act under the Grand Mentor's seal,

26:13.740 --> 26:14.460
but never forget,

26:14.940 --> 26:16.700
His Majesty's throne is supreme.

26:17.140 --> 26:18.580
Thank you, General, for the reminder.

26:19.340 --> 26:20.340
I shall take my leave.

26:26.220 --> 26:27.700
What a pathetic lackey.

26:28.340 --> 26:29.620
Flaunting Mr. Deng's support,

26:29.980 --> 26:30.700
he struts about the camp,

26:30.700 --> 26:32.220
lording it over everyone all day.

26:32.580 --> 26:33.500
Enough.

26:34.060 --> 26:35.660
If our people hadn't blundered,

26:35.940 --> 26:37.500
he wouldn't be in a position to gloat.

26:39.660 --> 26:40.140
General,

26:40.980 --> 26:41.900
what about Changping Pass?

26:42.300 --> 26:43.380
It's such a critical post.

26:43.620 --> 26:44.460
Who can we possibly send

26:44.540 --> 26:45.420
at such short notice?

26:55.540 --> 26:56.740
That brat

26:57.420 --> 26:58.500
finally made it back.

27:00.980 --> 27:02.060
The Military Supervisor is abusing his power.

27:05.460 --> 27:06.580
Your Highness, please have no concerns.

27:07.140 --> 27:08.500
General Zhong is steady and experienced,

27:08.900 --> 27:10.420
and General Xie has returned to the frontier.

27:10.780 --> 27:11.620
It will not fall into chaos.

27:13.100 --> 27:13.620
Deng Yi

27:13.620 --> 27:14.860
has abandoned all pretense.

27:15.540 --> 27:17.020
He is determined to undermine the frontier troops.

27:17.700 --> 27:18.140
Your Highness,

27:18.340 --> 27:19.460
we must guard against his next move.

27:19.660 --> 27:20.700
Of course he has a next move.

27:21.580 --> 27:22.340
Changing the commander

27:22.420 --> 27:23.740
at Changping Pass

27:24.300 --> 27:25.620
is all about installing

27:25.620 --> 27:26.580
his own people.

27:28.060 --> 27:29.500
But since Jiu has returned to the frontier,

27:30.300 --> 27:31.660
the outcome of this game

27:32.340 --> 27:34.140
will not be decided by Deng Yi.

27:36.940 --> 27:37.740
You brat,

27:37.860 --> 27:39.660
show some restraint once you arrive at Changping Pass.

27:39.980 --> 27:41.260
Too many eyes are fixed

27:41.260 --> 27:42.260
on the frontier troops.

27:42.420 --> 27:43.500
Even if you just pass wind,

27:43.700 --> 27:45.140
someone will submit a formal complaint against you.

27:45.340 --> 27:47.100
Stop nagging.

27:48.220 --> 27:49.820
I am more aware of these matters than you are.

27:52.660 --> 27:53.660
Zhong,

27:54.260 --> 27:55.180
without my support henceforth

27:55.180 --> 27:56.020
in the Yunzhong Prefecture,

27:56.580 --> 27:57.420
fend for yourself.

27:59.180 --> 28:00.860
Don't be annoyed by my nagging.

28:01.420 --> 28:02.380
Listen.

28:03.380 --> 28:04.500
If you do not correct

28:04.500 --> 28:05.340
your rashness

28:05.340 --> 28:06.220
and commit an error someday,

28:06.660 --> 28:08.180
no one will be able to save you,

28:08.660 --> 28:10.260
even if you're from the Xie Family.

28:10.780 --> 28:11.740
I have always fended for myself

28:13.540 --> 28:14.940
all my life.

28:15.260 --> 28:16.300
Spare me the nonsense.

28:16.940 --> 28:17.460
Tell me,

28:17.820 --> 28:19.220
what is the deal with that pledge?

28:21.180 --> 28:23.060
You do not even know

28:23.060 --> 28:24.020
where the Northern Desert King is hiding,

28:24.580 --> 28:25.620
so how do you intend to kill them?

28:26.500 --> 28:28.220
If it were so easy,

28:28.580 --> 28:29.980
I would have killed the man

28:30.020 --> 28:31.420
countless times these past twenty years.

28:31.660 --> 28:32.980
Do you really think it'd be your turn?

28:33.700 --> 28:34.460
I have

28:36.380 --> 28:37.340
my own ways.

28:38.660 --> 28:40.220
You? Seriously?

29:01.060 --> 29:01.820
If only

29:02.900 --> 29:04.500
those in the imperial court

29:04.540 --> 29:05.540
who squabble endlessly for their own gain

29:05.540 --> 29:07.500
could realize

29:08.540 --> 29:09.780
that our ultimate interest lies

29:10.620 --> 29:12.580
in defeating the Northern Desert.

29:19.580 --> 29:20.060
Zhao,

29:20.540 --> 29:21.940
I am in Jingzhou.

29:22.780 --> 29:24.660
Only after leaving the Capital did I realize

29:25.100 --> 29:26.820
that your reputation among the common people is immense.

29:27.580 --> 29:29.140
The women here in Jingzhou

29:29.460 --> 29:30.860
are also quite familiar with your story.

29:31.700 --> 29:32.860
I have held

29:32.980 --> 29:34.700
another literary gathering for women here,

29:35.340 --> 29:36.740
and they competed for a full half month.

29:37.700 --> 29:39.500
I am currently compiling the results

29:39.500 --> 29:40.940
of our literary gathering into a volume.

29:41.580 --> 29:43.460
I'll have it sent to you in a few days.

29:44.620 --> 29:45.620
Do remember to grace it with your calligraphy.

29:45.980 --> 29:47.380
I shall certainly sell it for an exorbitant price.

29:51.060 --> 29:51.980
I have seen Mr. Zhu,

29:51.980 --> 29:53.060
whom you sent

29:53.300 --> 29:54.020
to Jingzhou,

29:54.780 --> 29:56.700
and have been keeping an eye on him.

29:57.620 --> 29:59.300
He is reaching out

29:59.580 --> 30:01.100
to the local scholars one by one,

30:01.860 --> 30:04.060
inviting them to showcase their talents

30:04.340 --> 30:05.100
and reach for greater heights.

30:06.140 --> 30:07.340
He's using this

30:07.340 --> 30:08.660
to purge the Jingzhou ranks,

30:09.420 --> 30:10.500
weeding out

30:10.500 --> 30:11.820
the rot

30:12.820 --> 30:15.300
to elevate capable scholars.

30:16.500 --> 30:17.620
His words

30:18.020 --> 30:19.620
were reasonable, stirring, righteous

30:20.020 --> 30:20.660
and profitable too.

30:21.380 --> 30:22.460
The scholars of Jingzhou

30:22.700 --> 30:23.940
were instantly galvanized.

30:24.860 --> 30:26.300
The local officials

30:26.340 --> 30:27.380
had been considering

30:27.380 --> 30:28.460
how to give Zhu Yong the cold shoulder,

30:29.220 --> 30:30.620
but when he arrived,

30:30.940 --> 30:32.060
he did not even set foot in the yamen,

30:32.540 --> 30:33.940
and the scholars

30:34.060 --> 30:35.500
were already sworn to his cause.

30:36.420 --> 30:37.100
Zhu Yong

30:37.460 --> 30:38.500
may seem weak and pedantic,

30:38.980 --> 30:40.780
but he is surprisingly unconstrained in his methods.

30:41.900 --> 30:43.140
He is truly a talent worth using.

30:46.940 --> 30:47.620
Leyun,

30:48.540 --> 30:49.900
I heard you have something urgent to tell me.

30:50.060 --> 30:50.860
Zhao,

30:51.180 --> 30:52.020
still in the mood

30:52.020 --> 30:53.020
for swinging?

30:55.300 --> 30:55.780
Wait,

30:56.060 --> 30:56.740
I forgot something.

30:57.860 --> 30:58.980
Greetings, Your Highness.

30:59.020 --> 31:00.020
Spare me the formalities.

31:00.420 --> 31:00.900
What is it now?

31:01.060 --> 31:02.180
What news have you heard?

31:02.540 --> 31:03.460
Listen,

31:03.780 --> 31:04.740
the whole Capital uses

31:04.860 --> 31:05.740
the Imperial Guard Office

31:05.740 --> 31:06.660
to keep children in line.

31:07.060 --> 31:08.820
They tell them: "If you misbehave,

31:08.900 --> 31:10.300
the Imperial Guard Office will come take you away."

31:10.500 --> 31:11.380
It's like this

31:11.500 --> 31:12.820
on every street corner.

31:13.180 --> 31:13.940
Even if the Office

31:13.940 --> 31:15.060
does nothing,

31:15.220 --> 31:15.740
it has been turned into a bogeyman

31:15.740 --> 31:17.100
that stops children from crying.

31:17.220 --> 31:17.780
I know.

31:18.540 --> 31:19.860
Everyone is accusing

31:19.860 --> 31:20.700
and slandering the Imperial Guard Office,

31:21.980 --> 31:23.500
but the true goal is to slander me.

31:24.820 --> 31:26.260
I also know

31:26.380 --> 31:27.500
where these rumors started,

31:28.060 --> 31:29.180
and I have kept a record of them.

31:30.300 --> 31:30.980
Then why not have them

31:30.980 --> 31:32.100
all arrested immediately?

31:32.660 --> 31:33.660
There is no need.

31:35.540 --> 31:36.820
To dispel this rumor

31:37.180 --> 31:38.100
is actually quite simple.

31:38.740 --> 31:39.980
We only need to show people

31:40.220 --> 31:40.980
that the Imperial Guard Office

31:40.980 --> 31:42.300
is not a monster that frightens children,

31:42.900 --> 31:44.540
but a champion of justice.

31:45.340 --> 31:46.060
Come, Leyun.

31:46.740 --> 31:47.140
Let me tell you

31:47.140 --> 31:48.180
what to say to them.

31:52.060 --> 31:53.580
The scholars of Jingzhou

31:53.660 --> 31:56.100
respectfully thank Her Highness for her protection

31:56.700 --> 31:58.620
and present the Canopy of Insight.

31:59.260 --> 32:00.660
The scholars of Jingzhou

32:00.700 --> 32:03.020
respectfully thank Her Highness for her protection

32:03.780 --> 32:05.660
and present the Canopy of Insight.

32:05.940 --> 32:06.660
Look.

32:06.860 --> 32:08.380
Each patch of cloth on that canopy

32:08.420 --> 32:09.140
seems to bear

32:09.140 --> 32:10.020
a person's name.

32:10.060 --> 32:10.620
Indeed.

32:10.900 --> 32:12.580
Every scholar in Jingzhou

32:12.860 --> 32:14.460
tore a piece from their own robes

32:14.460 --> 32:15.340
and stitched it together into this canopy

32:15.820 --> 32:17.460
to thank Her Highness.

32:17.820 --> 32:20.020
But wasn't Jingzhou turned upside down

32:20.020 --> 32:21.140
by the Imperial Guard Office?

32:21.380 --> 32:22.980
Why are they thanking her?

32:23.340 --> 32:25.180
This egregious injustice finally came to light

32:25.540 --> 32:27.220
upon Her Highness's direct order for a full inquiry.

32:27.700 --> 32:28.860
Had she not intervened,

32:28.980 --> 32:29.980
the innocent would have died in vain,

32:30.340 --> 32:31.220
while the wicked remained at large.

32:31.620 --> 32:32.820
Senior officials colluded

32:32.820 --> 32:33.580
and protected one another,

32:34.020 --> 32:34.780
and only Her Highness

32:34.980 --> 32:35.900
could deal with them.

32:36.140 --> 32:37.340
But this is against the rules.

32:37.700 --> 32:39.140
The Imperial Guard Office has no authority to investigate cases,

32:39.380 --> 32:40.740
yet it acted beyond its power.

32:41.020 --> 32:42.180
How is that any different from those corrupt officials?

32:42.180 --> 32:43.100
The scholars of Jingzhou...

32:43.220 --> 32:44.180
Evil against evil,

32:44.300 --> 32:45.220
it is evil nonetheless.

32:46.260 --> 32:46.700
I

32:47.020 --> 32:48.380
do not care about the rules.

32:48.540 --> 32:49.220
I only know

32:49.620 --> 32:50.820
that those who seek justice for the people

32:51.060 --> 32:53.460
are true guardians of righteousness.

32:53.860 --> 32:54.660
Well said.

32:54.940 --> 32:55.980
I only know one principle,

32:56.180 --> 32:58.060
whoever punishes the wicked is a hero.

32:58.100 --> 32:58.780
Indeed.

33:00.060 --> 33:01.380
How beautiful that canopy is.

33:01.420 --> 33:02.860
It really was as Zhao predicted.

33:10.180 --> 33:11.900
Just how many people are there?

33:12.460 --> 33:14.180
There are silks and homespun.

33:14.700 --> 33:16.220
They must range from rich to poor.

33:16.420 --> 33:17.220
Besides their names,

33:17.740 --> 33:19.020
everyone also inscribed

33:19.140 --> 33:20.540
a line of ancient wisdom upon it.

33:20.860 --> 33:22.220
Yu, look at this.

33:22.700 --> 33:24.780
"A strong foundation and frugality assure freedom from poverty."

33:25.220 --> 33:26.780
Where does this come from, and what is the interpretation?

33:27.140 --> 33:27.980
Zhao,

33:28.220 --> 33:29.380
they didn't send this canopy

33:29.620 --> 33:30.300
to test

33:30.300 --> 33:31.620
my studies.

33:33.900 --> 33:34.500
Xiaoman,

33:35.220 --> 33:36.220
how about having Zhu Yong

33:36.300 --> 33:37.340
serve as your deputy?

33:37.860 --> 33:38.700
Him?

33:40.740 --> 33:41.500
He appears frail

33:41.780 --> 33:42.700
yet has quite a backbone.

33:43.300 --> 33:44.060
Just the sort I need.

33:44.380 --> 33:45.940
You'll command troops at the frontier sooner or later.

33:46.500 --> 33:47.180
The Imperial Guard Office

33:47.380 --> 33:48.100
will become

33:48.140 --> 33:49.340
a sharp blade to monitor all officials.

33:49.740 --> 33:50.820
Only someone as firm and flexible

33:51.140 --> 33:52.620
as Zhu Yong will do.

33:53.420 --> 33:54.740
As Your Highness wishes.

33:55.500 --> 33:56.660
I have committed my life

33:56.980 --> 33:57.860
to you.

33:58.900 --> 33:59.740
Very well.

34:00.020 --> 34:00.940
Xiaoman,

34:01.180 --> 34:02.300
you shall rise

34:02.580 --> 34:03.580
to General.

34:04.300 --> 34:04.820
Zhao,

34:05.420 --> 34:07.300
you should bring this canopy to the court tomorrow

34:07.740 --> 34:08.660
and show the officials

34:09.100 --> 34:10.860
the respect the scholars of Jingzhou have for you.

34:11.220 --> 34:12.780
I doubt anyone dares to speak out of turn.

34:13.660 --> 34:14.260
Yu,

34:15.300 --> 34:16.380
those people

34:17.060 --> 34:18.380
will not change their minds

34:18.780 --> 34:19.620
just by seeing this canopy.

34:20.420 --> 34:21.020
Besides,

34:21.700 --> 34:22.500
this canopy

34:22.980 --> 34:23.740
was never meant

34:23.740 --> 34:24.540
for them to see.

34:26.020 --> 34:27.940
It is for the people of the world.

34:30.500 --> 34:30.980
Liu,

34:31.620 --> 34:32.980
how are things at your estate today?

34:34.260 --> 34:34.740
Look!

34:36.180 --> 34:37.060
Which senior official

34:37.060 --> 34:38.620
is the Imperial Guard Office going after now?

34:39.500 --> 34:40.260
Whoever it is,

34:40.460 --> 34:42.140
they must be corrupt.

34:42.580 --> 34:43.700
Gentlemen,

34:43.980 --> 34:44.940
just eat your meal.

34:45.180 --> 34:45.700
Either way,

34:45.740 --> 34:47.380
they won't be coming for the common folk.

34:47.660 --> 34:48.980
- True. - You are right.

34:49.020 --> 34:49.660
- Indeed. - Correct.

34:50.420 --> 34:51.940
Her Highness commanded the Imperial Guard Office

34:51.940 --> 34:53.020
to surround the Directorate for Imperial Manufactories at once.

34:53.700 --> 34:54.980
The ledgers exposed the rot at once.

34:56.020 --> 34:57.020
The funds for the summer floods in Huzhou

34:57.020 --> 34:58.620
were skimmed layer by layer from top to bottom.

34:59.300 --> 34:59.780
Dikes and canals

34:59.780 --> 35:00.940
that should have been repaired once

35:00.940 --> 35:01.740
were being rebuilt year after year.

35:02.460 --> 35:03.660
Deputy Prefect Du not only exposed

35:03.660 --> 35:04.780
these ledgers in the imperial court

35:05.460 --> 35:06.140
but also

35:06.140 --> 35:07.060
voluntarily handed over

35:07.060 --> 35:07.780
private letters.

35:08.620 --> 35:10.340
With witnesses and evidence secured,

35:11.500 --> 35:13.100
Mr. Deng is left without a word.

35:14.420 --> 35:15.540
Furthermore,

35:16.380 --> 35:17.220
this will undoubtedly lead to

35:17.220 --> 35:18.620
exposing more corruption.

35:19.820 --> 35:21.420
But Deputy Prefect Du also threw himself into prison.

35:22.140 --> 35:23.060
What is he after?

35:23.660 --> 35:24.220
Has he lost his mind?

35:24.700 --> 35:25.860
He hasn't lost his mind.

35:27.780 --> 35:28.980
He is fighting to the death.

35:30.180 --> 35:31.060
Do you remember, years ago

35:31.060 --> 35:32.020
at Mr. Deng's family banquet,

35:32.620 --> 35:34.220
two men argued

35:34.260 --> 35:35.140
over a marriage arrangement?

35:35.900 --> 35:36.940
One was Tian Lin, Chief Secretary

35:36.940 --> 35:38.780
of the Court of the Imperial Treasury,

35:39.300 --> 35:40.660
and the other was Deputy Prefect Du.

35:41.140 --> 35:42.260
They quarreled

35:42.900 --> 35:44.140
because their families had discussed

35:44.140 --> 35:45.340
a marriage a year prior,

35:47.140 --> 35:48.380
between Tian Lin's eldest son

35:49.140 --> 35:50.580
and Mr. Du's only daughter.

35:52.100 --> 35:52.860
Unfortunately,

35:54.260 --> 35:55.700
Tian's son was a wastrel,

35:56.740 --> 35:57.980
and Mr. Du did not approve.

35:59.980 --> 36:01.540
This angered the Tian Family.

36:02.380 --> 36:04.380
Earlier this year, while Miss Du was out,

36:04.620 --> 36:06.660
she encountered a startled horse and broke her leg,

36:09.300 --> 36:10.900
leaving her with a permanent limp.

36:11.380 --> 36:12.420
Was this the Tian Family's doing?

36:13.420 --> 36:14.940
Miss Du did encounter Mr. Tian

36:16.100 --> 36:17.620
while she was out,

36:18.260 --> 36:19.900
but there is no evidence

36:21.220 --> 36:22.460
that he was responsible.

36:23.220 --> 36:25.020
Though Tian Lin holds a lower position than Mr. Du,

36:25.900 --> 36:27.100
he is much closer to Mr. Deng.

36:28.100 --> 36:28.740
Even if Mr. Du complained to Mr. Deng,

36:28.740 --> 36:29.820
it would be useless.

36:30.300 --> 36:31.500
Tian Lin pays Mr. Deng

36:32.540 --> 36:33.860
far more than Mr. Du does.

36:34.460 --> 36:35.420
Mr. Deng

36:36.580 --> 36:38.060
is always impartial.

36:39.220 --> 36:40.500
While he did dismiss Tian Lin from office,

36:41.500 --> 36:43.100
it was not enough

36:43.100 --> 36:44.020
to settle Mr. Du's grudge.

36:46.140 --> 36:47.500
Through these contests,

36:48.820 --> 36:51.020
more than half of Deng Yi's pupils have been lost.

36:52.620 --> 36:54.300
The landscape of the imperial court

36:55.100 --> 36:56.820
has been turned upside down.

36:57.740 --> 36:58.980
But how did Her Highness

36:58.980 --> 36:59.780
find out

37:00.180 --> 37:00.740
about these private matters

37:00.740 --> 37:01.540
between the Tian and Du Families?

37:02.780 --> 37:04.380
She now holds the Imperial Guard Office.

37:05.940 --> 37:06.780
From now on,

37:07.860 --> 37:09.180
she will be able to find out

37:10.340 --> 37:12.420
whatever I can know as well.

37:15.660 --> 37:17.540
What a masterful move.

37:18.220 --> 37:19.140
By creating such a scene,

37:19.980 --> 37:20.700
does she think

37:20.700 --> 37:22.060
she can rule the court?

37:22.580 --> 37:24.020
The people's favor matters little.

37:24.580 --> 37:26.060
Commoners cannot speak in court.

37:26.740 --> 37:27.980
With public support

37:28.940 --> 37:30.540
and Deng Yi's influence diminished,

37:31.380 --> 37:32.140
she has finally gained

37:32.140 --> 37:33.700
the leverage to challenge me.

37:35.740 --> 37:36.740
It is time

37:36.740 --> 37:37.860
we let Her Highness know

37:39.140 --> 37:40.220
that she is not the only player

37:40.940 --> 37:42.300
in this imperial court.

37:43.980 --> 37:44.860
Having been tended to

37:44.860 --> 37:45.740
for all this time,

37:46.660 --> 37:47.660
your cold should be healed by now.

37:49.580 --> 37:50.460
How is Yanlai?

37:50.980 --> 37:51.900
He has reached Yunzhong Prefecture

37:52.700 --> 37:53.940
and is en route to Changping Pass.

37:54.580 --> 37:56.340
Whether our sharpest weapon

37:58.460 --> 38:00.180
can bring down the Northern Desert King or not

38:02.620 --> 38:04.300
remains to be seen.

38:10.100 --> 38:11.620
This year's new tea from Lingnan

38:11.900 --> 38:12.780
has a fine flavor.

38:14.540 --> 38:15.780
Mr. Deng, what refined pleasures you keep.

38:16.460 --> 38:17.100
Your Highness,

38:17.980 --> 38:18.900
did you enjoy

38:19.420 --> 38:20.940
the performance?

38:33.380 --> 38:34.500
Mr. Deng, what refined pleasures you keep.

38:37.820 --> 38:39.660
Upright and virtuous at court,

38:39.820 --> 38:41.060
while behind closed doors you let your pupils

38:41.060 --> 38:41.940
run rampant with corruption.

38:42.900 --> 38:44.220
Quite the act.

38:44.540 --> 38:45.980
Likewise.

38:46.460 --> 38:47.420
You saved Zheng Xia

38:47.980 --> 38:49.980
merely to gain people's favor, didn't you?

38:50.420 --> 38:51.540
After the siege of Xiaonan Prefecture,

38:52.300 --> 38:54.340
Xie Yanfang seized control of half the Imperial Guards,

38:54.780 --> 38:56.420
and even His Majesty trusts him utterly.

38:57.420 --> 38:58.780
No matter how many pupils you have,

38:59.820 --> 39:01.060
it might be difficult

39:01.780 --> 39:03.380
to shake the Xie Family.

39:07.300 --> 39:09.020
Did Your Highness come at such a late hour

39:09.580 --> 39:10.620
just to tell me this?

39:11.500 --> 39:12.780
If Xie Yanfang gains power,

39:13.260 --> 39:14.460
the first person he will remove

39:15.060 --> 39:16.820
is you, the Regent and Grand Mentor.

39:17.540 --> 39:18.820
But by cooperating with me,

39:19.540 --> 39:21.220
you might at least be able to struggle and survive.

39:23.780 --> 39:25.140
What would you have me do?

39:25.980 --> 39:26.740
It is simple.

39:27.300 --> 39:28.380
Act as an opponent

39:29.060 --> 39:29.700
who wants

39:29.700 --> 39:31.420
to put me to death in the court.

39:34.820 --> 39:36.740
Are you not afraid I'll make it real?

39:37.300 --> 39:38.820
If you wish,

39:39.780 --> 39:40.940
you may try.

39:46.580 --> 39:47.140
Of course,

39:47.820 --> 39:48.500
I will also return

39:48.500 --> 39:49.660
your blows with all my might

39:50.460 --> 39:51.700
to ensure Xie Yanfang

39:51.820 --> 39:52.780
sees no flaws.

39:53.860 --> 39:55.580
I have been delving into Chenxiang.

39:58.260 --> 39:59.460
Does Your Highness know

40:00.300 --> 40:01.900
what makes it so exquisite?

40:04.220 --> 40:05.260
It seems gentle,

40:06.140 --> 40:07.740
yet flares fiercely once touched by fire.

40:08.500 --> 40:10.140
Much like our performance.

40:10.980 --> 40:12.500
It must appear convincing,

40:13.260 --> 40:15.300
while still leaving room to maneuver.

40:15.860 --> 40:17.140
You're smart enough

40:18.220 --> 40:19.380
to know which path to choose.

40:23.580 --> 40:24.700
Your performance

40:25.140 --> 40:26.060
was excellent.

40:26.500 --> 40:27.380
Indeed.

40:28.860 --> 40:30.740
I have lost

40:30.740 --> 40:32.140
my most valued pupils.

40:32.740 --> 40:33.860
Your sacrifice

40:34.420 --> 40:35.580
will not go unrewarded.

40:37.660 --> 40:38.220
When?

40:39.380 --> 40:40.940
You should get some rest.

40:54.100 --> 40:55.940
Mr. Deng, after all your work with Her Highness,

40:56.620 --> 40:57.940
why have you gained nothing?

40:58.500 --> 40:59.300
Gain?

41:01.060 --> 41:02.220
Staying alive

41:02.220 --> 41:02.940
is reward enough.

41:05.580 --> 41:06.580
And yet,

41:07.780 --> 41:08.820
this game

41:09.780 --> 41:11.180
permits no retreat.

41:14.060 --> 41:14.540
Your Highness,

41:15.020 --> 41:16.300
all those involved in the Jingzhou examination fraud

41:16.580 --> 41:17.540
have been apprehended.

41:17.860 --> 41:18.820
Execute them according to the law.

41:19.220 --> 41:19.980
No mercy.

41:20.940 --> 41:21.540
Your Highness,

41:21.900 --> 41:23.100
I just cast a divination

41:23.100 --> 41:23.820
for General Xie.

41:23.980 --> 41:24.860
Fire rising into the sky.
[*The Hexagram of Li]

41:25.460 --> 41:26.460
Bloodshed is...

41:32.100 --> 41:33.180
Did I not tell you

41:33.860 --> 41:34.980
not to divine for him?

41:36.540 --> 41:38.140
I simply could not resist.

41:38.420 --> 41:39.900
Are you mocking my commands?

41:40.140 --> 41:41.500
Even children heed such warnings. But you...

41:41.540 --> 41:42.420
Your Highness, worry not.

41:42.980 --> 41:43.780
The Hexagram of Li

41:43.860 --> 41:45.060
may yet portend a great victory.

41:45.700 --> 41:46.580
With wood fueling the fire,

41:47.020 --> 41:48.260
General Xie's brilliance in command

41:48.580 --> 41:49.700
will surely turn this peril into triumph.

41:50.260 --> 41:51.260
Your Highness, please forgive me.

41:51.540 --> 41:52.540
I will never divine

41:52.540 --> 41:53.540
for General Xie again.

41:53.740 --> 41:54.220
Truly.

41:54.620 --> 41:55.460
I swear it.

42:14.580 --> 42:15.420
Le, my apology.

42:17.140 --> 42:18.380
I should not have lost my temper with you.

42:19.100 --> 42:20.140
I know your anger springs

42:20.140 --> 42:21.380
from caring too much for General Xie.

42:22.060 --> 42:23.060
It is my fault.

42:25.700 --> 42:26.900
The situation is unclear.

42:28.980 --> 42:29.940
I confess I am afraid.

42:30.500 --> 42:31.420
Your Highness, do not fear.

42:31.820 --> 42:33.300
That divination was just a random attempt.

42:33.420 --> 42:34.300
It can't be accurate.

42:34.660 --> 42:35.540
General Xie

42:35.540 --> 42:36.380
will return safely.

42:36.860 --> 42:38.300
You are waiting for him, after all.

42:40.020 --> 42:40.980
You may leave.

43:27.140 --> 43:28.220
By the moon above,

43:30.620 --> 43:31.860
I, Zhao,

43:33.540 --> 43:35.620
pray only for Jiu's safe and victorious return.

43:58.220 --> 44:02.820
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

44:03.100 --> 44:05.580
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

44:05.620 --> 44:09.660
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

44:11.900 --> 44:14.020
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

44:14.100 --> 44:16.060
♪And roars in the blaze♪

44:16.140 --> 44:19.380
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

44:19.540 --> 44:21.780
♪Fate imprisons me♪

44:21.940 --> 44:26.740
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

44:26.740 --> 44:30.940
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

44:30.940 --> 44:35.220
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

44:35.220 --> 44:40.660
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

44:40.660 --> 44:42.620
♪With no fear of the distance♪

44:42.620 --> 44:46.340
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

44:46.340 --> 44:50.780
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

44:50.780 --> 44:56.140
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

44:56.140 --> 44:59.740
♪My new pride♪

45:14.460 --> 45:17.340
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

45:17.340 --> 45:19.860
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

45:19.860 --> 45:21.800
♪Amidst the chaos♪

45:21.840 --> 45:27.440
♪I'll always be with you♪

45:27.980 --> 45:30.100
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

45:30.180 --> 45:32.140
♪And roars in the blaze♪

45:32.220 --> 45:35.460
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

45:35.620 --> 45:37.860
♪Fate imprisons me♪

45:38.020 --> 45:42.820
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

45:42.820 --> 45:47.020
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

45:47.020 --> 45:51.300
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

45:51.300 --> 45:56.740
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

45:56.740 --> 45:58.700
♪With no fear of the distance♪

45:58.700 --> 46:02.420
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

46:02.420 --> 46:06.860
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

46:07.640 --> 46:12.220
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

46:12.560 --> 46:15.820
♪My new pride♪
